    },
    {
        "text": "S-She's strong...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria Punk B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not half bad, I'll give you that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Uda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't get cocky, Eunectes!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aruna"
    },
    {
        "text": "All of you, on me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aruna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm, I knew it! Zumama's so tough!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "She may be fighting alone, but just like Gavial, your everyday Archosauria goonies are no match for her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "It sounds like you know her pretty well.;......;She's so cool...",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep, Zumama and Gavial have always been the strongest around here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "But as far as I know, Zumama has never managed to beat Gavial!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor. I bet you don't see people this strong on the outside!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Gavial's even stronger than her!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, I agree. Zumama is cool.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Gavial's way cooler!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, Gavial?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Where's Gavial?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, look! Over there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I saw her on my way here! Isn't that\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "name2": "avg_npc_072",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She really is back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
