    {
        "text": "Are you really a doctor now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe, I'm a pretty famous doctor out there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's amazing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you? You didn't show up last time because you were tinkering with something, right? You done with that yet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll get to see it very soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
