    {
        "text": "You're as strong as I remember.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, you ain't half bad either!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But you rely on your fists too much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You can do all sorts of things with your fists, so you don't ever think of using anything else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's what's holding you back, and it's what's holding all of us back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you talking about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I'm trying to say is it's time for change.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
