        "text": "Just then, a thunderous, uniform roar reverberates through the forest. Something gigantic is approaching the Temple."
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever it is, it is slowly but surely stomping its way towards the Temple, and although it has so far remained largely out of sight, it has already proven to be an imposing presence."
    },
